# The inputs of the RC-10c install images with the plain Done screen (KIND=release): mainline-rc10c-install.inputs
# (INSTALLER_COMMIT eafc199, tokens pxx-inst-804423 / pxx-inst-c67e28) with one change (owner 2026-11-17): the unit's Done
# screen of the direct mainline install shows only the plain lines; the slot state, the fallback line, the mark rule and
# the cable rule go to the flow log. INSTALLER_COMMIT = eafc199 + that commit. Every other value is RC-10c's, also the
# times: the kernel Image is the same bytes. New tokens (used by no other inputs file). image/build.sh --install --board
# both --inputs THIS-FILE, from INSTALLER_COMMIT. The images are for no unit until the release review names their sha256
# and the safety rules name the image and the unit.
